 "open": [
  "Swarm agents (Breakroom roster) are not targets: the swarm exposes no capability for its roster, and plugins may not read each other's folders. Agents come from axf.agents@1 only. A small `agents@1` read on the swarm would add them.",
  "Builds declare touches only in text (`touches:` in detail, steps or notes). The orchestrator has no `touches` field yet; `refTargetFromBuild` already reads `b.touches` when one appears.",
  "Show in UI Review opens UI Review (or the item's URL when the item carries one), not a specific item: UI Review has no deep link to one item. The predicted shot (`ui-review-predicted`) is not on main yet.",
  "Kotlin twin deferred (Android on hold).",
  "Fable review suggested for the ref@1 contract (it is a cross-app GUI behaviour contract built on Opus, like plugin-settings-placement s1)."
 ]
}
